# playpick: mode=raid boss=whisper spec=hunter:marksmanship style=flee size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=1280x800 save=fresh
#
# direction.md #1 already has one flee-style loss on this exact spec/boss/size/
# difficulty (2026-09-26-48.play), but only reached by mode=walk/clear -- an
# evening that had already spent Bonegrinder and four corridors before Whisper
# woke, and only on a touch viewport (390x844). That entry's own read, from
# src/sim/combat.ts, is that the enrage aura amplifies whatever the boss's
# ordinary hits already land, so a style built entirely around dodging
# telegraphs has nothing to dodge once plain damage alone is lethal -- a claim
# about the boss, not about the evening that led into it. This is the direct
# raid-hash pull of the same cell (no prior rooms, no raid attrition carried
# in, desktop 1280x800 instead of touch) to see whether the same shape holds
# with the evening's own confound removed, and whether a same-session retry
# (a real pull two, sharper AI, not a fresh `open`'s pull one again) still
# loses the same way or finds the enrage survivable once positioning is the
# only variable left.
open #b=whisper&s=25&h=1
targets
tap class:hunter:marksmanship
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
play flee 80
bill
shot mid1
state
play flee 80
bill
shot mid2
state
tap outcome:retry
targets
shot after-retry
state
play flee 80
bill
shot mid3
state
play flee 80
bill
shot end
state
